  "description": "This is a 3D scan of a parcel locker station called a Pick Locker. These lockers are available islandwide in Singapore and are open 24/7 serving as convenient parcel delivery collection points for consumers. This was part of a [nationwide parcel delivery locker network rollout](https://www.straitstimes.com/tech/tech-news/govts-pick-parcel-delivery-locker-network-launched-with-over-200-lockers-deployed) which began with 200 lockers in 30th April 2021. This has since grown to 1000 lockers islandwide. 3D scan captured with Reality Scan.",
